    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Kernel TLS (kTLS)",
      "source_hash": 2847670813044963285,
      "context_hash": 16468174609099531622,
      "translation": "커널 TLS(kTLS)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952741Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "In-kernel TLS record layer for zero-copy HTTPS",
      "source_hash": 17270603825168963882,
      "context_hash": 11506501238608488259,
      "translation": "제로 카피 HTTPS를 위한 커널 내 TLS 레코드 계층",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "zero-copy": "제로 카피"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952742Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The problem kTLS solves",
      "source_hash": 10463965493022729035,
      "context_hash": 1725752934339727630,
      "translation": "kTLS가 해결하는 문제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952742Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Traditionally, TLS runs entirely in userspace (OpenSSL):",
      "source_hash": 1112344683540461232,
      "context_hash": 15817702185727689265,
      "translation": "전통적으로 TLS는 전부 사용자 공간(OpenSSL)에서 실행됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952742Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "This means:",
      "source_hash": 1857746201768708929,
      "context_hash": 13452339953109647448,
      "translation": "이는 다음을 의미합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "This means:": "이는 다음을 의미합니다."
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952743Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Every TLS record copy: user buffer → kernel socket buffer",
      "source_hash": 8394098674064492615,
      "context_hash": 17550956749195088636,
      "translation": "모든 TLS 레코드 복사: 사용자 버퍼 → 커널 소켓 버퍼",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952743Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`sendfile()` doesn't work: data must pass through userspace for encryption",
      "source_hash": 12505499707421079058,
      "context_hash": 16231120729037496904,
      "translation": "`sendfile()`이 동작하지 않음: 암호화를 위해 데이터가 사용자 공간을 거쳐야 함",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "encryption": "암호화",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952743Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "TLS offload to NIC requires kernel involvement anyway",
      "source_hash": 14150418262404839363,
      "context_hash": 12171434195495416554,
      "translation": "NIC로의 TLS 오프로드에는 어차피 커널의 개입이 필요함",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NIC": "NIC",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952744Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "kTLS moves the TLS record layer into the kernel:",
      "source_hash": 13869891137458885331,
      "context_hash": 15101924223501358534,
      "translation": "kTLS는 TLS 레코드 계층을 커널 안으로 옮깁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952744Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Benefits:",
      "source_hash": 16157224011853046347,
      "context_hash": 18242242913707868329,
      "translation": "장점:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Benefits:": "장점"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:30:43.569875Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "`sendfile()` works for TLS: zero-copy file → TLS → NIC",
      "source_hash": 2030003370768583115,
      "context_hash": 12182927621341845390,
      "translation": "TLS에서 `sendfile()` 동작: 제로 카피 파일 → TLS → NIC",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NIC": "NIC",
        "zero-copy": "제로 카피"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952744Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "NIC TLS offload: kernel can push crypto to hardware",
      "source_hash": 15219894257910760029,
      "context_hash": 8796763675431432681,
      "translation": "NIC TLS 오프로드: 커널이 암호화 작업을 하드웨어로 넘길 수 있음",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NIC": "NIC",
        "crypto": "암호화",
        "hardware": "하드웨어",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952744Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "Lower CPU usage for TLS-heavy workloads (nginx, envoy)",
      "source_hash": 11696059293018498446,
      "context_hash": 8789492545558127162,
      "translation": "TLS 부하가 큰 워크로드(nginx, envoy)의 CPU 사용량 감소",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "workload": "워크로드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952744Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "ULP: Upper Layer Protocol",
      "source_hash": 16694208609567790111,
      "context_hash": 786969073912361002,
      "translation": "ULP: Upper Layer Protocol",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952744Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "kTLS is implemented as a ULP (Upper Layer Protocol) — a socket layer that intercepts send/receive between the application and TCP:",
      "source_hash": 6590652294542003092,
      "context_hash": 17767230157549969726,
      "translation": "kTLS는 ULP(Upper Layer Protocol), 즉 애플리케이션과 TCP 사이의 송수신을 가로채는 소켓 계층으로 구현됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952744Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Setting up kTLS",
      "source_hash": 17354508271819018102,
      "context_hash": 15630752208506619179,
      "translation": "kTLS 설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952744Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "kTLS setup is done after the TLS handshake completes (e.g., via OpenSSL):",
      "source_hash": 15583695349645936381,
      "context_hash": 15196714236037308028,
      "translation": "kTLS 설정은 TLS 핸드셰이크가 완료된 후(예: OpenSSL을 통해) 수행됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952745Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Supported cipher suites",
      "source_hash": 10776874031988197236,
      "context_hash": 8452075822498433799,
      "translation": "지원되는 암호 스위트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952745Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "kTLS in the kernel",
      "source_hash": 13257677251832563122,
      "context_hash": 3272607647337569331,
      "translation": "커널 내부의 kTLS",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952745Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "NIC TLS offload",
      "source_hash": 9113022955839548743,
      "context_hash": 209964636499154647,
      "translation": "NIC TLS 오프로드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NIC": "NIC"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952745Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "For hardware that supports TLS offload, kTLS can push crypto to the NIC:",
      "source_hash": 4556551721603130456,
      "context_hash": 11780178931549175290,
      "translation": "TLS 오프로드를 지원하는 하드웨어의 경우 kTLS는 암호화 작업을 NIC로 넘길 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NIC": "NIC",
        "crypto": "암호화",
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952745Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "NIC TLS offload support: Mellanox ConnectX-6 Dx (ConnectX-5 does not support TLS offload), Intel E810, some Chelsio NICs.",
      "source_hash": 14271001959763026327,
      "context_hash": 4316115465785493822,
      "translation": "NIC TLS 오프로드 지원: Mellanox ConnectX-6 Dx(ConnectX-5는 TLS 오프로드를 지원하지 않습니다), Intel E810, 일부 Chelsio NIC.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Intel": "Intel",
        "NIC": "NIC",
        "NICs": "NIC"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:35:07.952745Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Zero-copy sendfile for HTTPS",
      "source_hash": 9243623457485172640,
      "context_hash": 13019956426652337389,
      "translation": "HTTPS를 위한 제로 카피 sendfile",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
